00:01:39.687 --> 00:01:41.255
Now, what the key here is going

00:01:41.389 --> 00:01:42.924
to be, how much time is the

00:01:42.924 --> 00:01:43.992
special counsel going to take to

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.427
