00:01:51.766 --> 00:01:52.300
investigation, potentially

00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:53.835
before these executive privilege

00:01:53.968 --> 00:01:56.604
and other matters are resolved,

00:01:56.938 --> 00:01:57.071
Jim.

00:01:57.071 --> 00:01:59.640
&gt;&gt; All right, Jeremy herb, a

00:01:59.774 --> 00:02:00.942
